# Owner-requested copy removal in all bundled reference screens.
fold folded
rotate portrait
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es design Setup
wait 6000
expect DESIGN REFERENCE
expect Privy makes a new wallet just for Hunch
absent NEETbux
shot hunch-copy-setup
fold open
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es design Money
wait 6000
expect DESIGN REFERENCE
expect Privy wallet
absent NEETbux
shot hunch-copy-money
fold folded
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es design Flow
wait 6000
expect DESIGN REFERENCE
tap GET STARTED
expect STEP 1 OF 3
expect Privy makes a wallet just for Hunch
absent NEETbux
shot hunch-copy-flow
# Actual wallet UI copy; fictional wallet only, no real account or funds.
shell am force-stop dev.omalauncher.hunch
shell am start -n dev.omalauncher.hunch/.MainActivity --es walletFixture demo
wait 6000
expect Create Hunch wallet
tap Create Hunch wallet
expect Your Hunch wallet is ready
absent NEETbux
shot hunch-copy-wallet
[phone] After installing0.5.1, owner reopens existing wallet; intro says Your Hunch wallet is ready, no old treasury-brand reference. Wallet/address stay unchanged. Do not create another wallet or send funds.
